# Implementation Plan - IndexedDB Store Consolidation & Client/Server Fixes

This plan consolidates all room key storage in IndexedDB into the version-aware store (`room-key-versions`), removes the legacy `room-keys` store, and resolves the compilation/build errors.

## User Review Required

No critical review required.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. IndexedDB Refactoring

#### [MODIFY] [crypto.ts](file:///c:/Users/REYANSH/OneDrive/Desktop/DeChat/packages/frontend/src/lib/crypto.ts)
- Update IndexedDB version and delete references to the legacy `ROOM_KEY_STORE` (`room-keys`).
- In `getDB()`, do not initialize `ROOM_KEY_STORE`.
- Refactor helper functions to query/update `ROOM_KEY_VERSIONS_STORE` (`room-key-versions`):
  - `saveRoomKey(roomId, roomKey)`: Stores the key under version `0` in `ROOM_KEY_VERSIONS_STORE`.
  - `getRoomKey(roomId)`: Retrieves the latest key version from `ROOM_KEY_VERSIONS_STORE` by calling `getLatestRoomKeyVersion(roomId)`.
  - `removeRoomKey(roomId)`: Deletes all key versions for the room by calling `deleteAllRoomKeyVersions(roomId)`.

